ed}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (本文件定义)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter2\\text{-}filter\\text{-}generated} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter2FilterGenerated}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal B,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\mathcal B\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\varnothing\\notin\\mathcal B\\land\\forall B_0,B_1\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\exists B_2\\in\\mathcal B\\;(B_2\\subseteq B_0\\cap B_1)\\land\\mathcal F=\\{A\\subseteq X:\\exists B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(B\\subseteq A)\\}\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal P(X),\\{\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(X)\\times\\mathcal P(X):A\\subseteq B\\})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter2\\text{-}filter\\text{-}generated} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter2FilterGenerated}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal B,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\mathcal B\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\varnothing\\notin\\mathcal B\\land\\forall B_0,B_1\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\exists B_2\\in\\mathcal B\\;(B_2\\subseteq B_0\\cap B_1)\\land\\mathcal F=\\{A\\subseteq X:\\exists B\\in\\mathcal B\\;(B\\subseteq A)\\}\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal P(X),\\{\\langle A,B\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(X)\\times\\mathcal P(X):A\\subseteq B\\})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li>上游三元谓词是偏序滤子；这里以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal P(X),\\subseteq)\">\\((\\mathcal P(X),\\subseteq)\\)</span> 为偏序，因此其向上闭与向下有向子句恰好给出通常的集合滤子。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnc